==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Sir Seal
|Sir Metal Seal
|Sir Seal's [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant, with a higher attack rate, damage and health, as well as having the usual attributes of a Metal enemy.
|Imperator Sael
|Sir Seal's [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant. He is much stronger and can slow the movement of Cat Units. However, he is slower in terms of speed and attack speed, and has more knockbacks.
|Zir Zeal
|Sir Seal's [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant. He has much higher stats in all areas than Sir Seal, combined with a Freeze ability and the regular [[Burrow|Zombie]]-[[Revive|type]] abilities.
|Baron Seal
|A [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of Sir Seal appearing in [[Baron Seal Strikes]]. This seal appears with a large variety of buffs in the stages he appears in, and can also weaken and freeze Cat Units.
}}

